From 978ba7b3c7b20d3d0ef8f800453f2d234de40433 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ahmed Yasser <midogamer100@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:12:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add optional extension integration API (/internal/v1),
 disabled by default

Additive, read-only integration surface for the extension services.
Registered only when NVB_INTEGRATION_ENABLED=true; with the default
(false) the router is not imported and existing behaviour is unchanged.

- Scoped bearer client credentials; only SHA-256 digests stored in a
  mounted JSON file, re-read on change (rotation without restart).
  Missing/invalid config fails closed.
- Session introspection reusing load_session (same expiry, logout and
  suspension semantics) with server-side CSRF check and a stable subject.
- statement-v1 dataset: manifest in one REPEATABLE READ READ ONLY
  snapshot with ledger reconciliation, half-open UTC periods, settle
  window, keyset-paginated entries without a row cap, bounded
  concurrent exports (429), audit events.
- Batch account discovery with explicit scope.
- No schema change. Customer routes, require_customer, owned_account,
  money handling and idempotency untouched.
- Test fix: test_metrics_labels_use_route_templates_not_ids now checks
  label values only (float samples could contain "999999").

Tested on SQLite only (175 passed); PostgreSQL run pending.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
